      "cooked": "<p>Upon creating an asset entry with calculated deprecation. I’ve encountered this kind of error which I think its a bug. Fiscal Year start at <strong>14-01-2026</strong> and <strong>13-01-2027</strong>, which is the posting date is within the fiscal year.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b930bef81e39455b2525d6ca5652da94cffccc1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3b930bef81e39455b2525d6ca5652da94cffccc1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3b930bef81e39455b2525d6ca5652da94cffccc1_2_690x211.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8v1dqYfMKqJZRbYTz7QaB3tOMg1\" width=\"690\" height=\"211\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3b930bef81e39455b2525d6ca5652da94cffccc1_2_690x211.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b930bef81e39455b2525d6ca5652da94cffccc1.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3b930bef81e39455b2525d6ca5652da94cffccc1.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1E1E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1018×312 20.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/c/cc9d68782167fb56b41abc1767e8578adda06cc8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/cc9d68782167fb56b41abc1767e8578adda06cc8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/cc9d68782167fb56b41abc1767e8578adda06cc8_2_690x101.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"tc6EfEGivMA87HYHD2DS92xcC